  Fingerprint(data) == Fingerprint(Reshape(data, ...))
  Fingerprint(data) == Fingerprint(Bitcast(data, ...))
  ```

  For string data, one should expect `Fingerprint(data) !=
  Fingerprint(ReduceJoin(data))` in general.

